{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a6ed12c3-865f-8144-b2a7-387684bd3473",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T13:41:32-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Linh Mensah",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:37:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Water and Sewer billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:37:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. My name is Linh Mensah. I am calling because I want to understand my water bill. I am renting, but the bill is in my name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:37:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. What's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:37:26-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is more high than I expect. Last year, in the winter, the bills were much, much lower. This time it is almost, um, double. I am making a budget for the new year, so I want to see the usage for each month."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:37:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a month-by-month breakdown. I can look that up. Can I get the account number, or the service address on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:37:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The account number I have here. [pause] It is... sorry, the line is not so good, I am in the car. Can you hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:37:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little choppy, but I've got you. Go ahead with the number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:38:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. It is four, four, one, [line breaks up] seven, seven, zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:38:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I lost the middle of that. Can you say it again, slowly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:38:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. Four, four, one, eight, seven, seven, zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:38:17-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four four one eight seven seven zero. Got it, and the name matches. Okay, I see the account. So what I can see here is the readings by billing period. Newport bills on a cycle, so it's not exactly calendar months, but it'll be close enough for a budget."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:38:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is fine. Close is fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:38:37-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The most recent bill shows noticeably more usage than the same period last year. Quite a bit more. Could be a running toilet, a dripping faucet, or just more people home. A toilet that leaks quietly can add a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:38:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah. A toilet. I will check this, I put the coloring in the tank like they say. Thank you. But can you send me the numbers? I want to write them down, or you can send by mail?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:39:04-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can mail a usage history to the address on the account, or I can read it to you now if you've got a pen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:39:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please read now. I have the pen. [crosstalk] Sorry, go on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:39:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you go. I was just going to say, I'll start with the latest and go backward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:39:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:39:27-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Latest period is about eleven thousand gallons. The one before, about nine thousand. The one before that, around seven thousand. And same time last year, the winter ones were around four thousand each."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:39:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four thousand. So now it is more than double. Okay. I write. Eleven, nine, seven, and last year four. Thank you, this helps me very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:39:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. I'll also put in a mailing of the full history, so you've got it on paper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:39:55-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And one more thing. I am leaving on a trip, the day after tomorrow, for some weeks. I want to pay the bill before I go, but I do not want to come in to City Hall. How can I pay outside the hours, or from the phone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:40:12-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. You've got a few options. There's online payment through the city website, which works any hour. There's also a drop box at City Hall for checks, and you can mail a check too. If you want to pay by phone with a card, you can call during business hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:40:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Online is okay for me. I need the account number only?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:40:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Account number, and usually something from the bill like the service address or the amount due. Have the bill handy and it'll walk you through."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:40:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Sorry, my car, the heater has only two settings. Off, and roaring. So I am turning it, off, on, off, and the noise is on the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:40:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear it a bit. Sounds like you're in the winter fight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:41:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. Okay. Then I pay online tonight, and I check the toilet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:41:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds like a plan. If you want, I'll note the account so that the history goes out in the mail today. Do you need the phone number on file confirmed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:41:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes please. It is four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-nine-three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:41:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, zero one nine three. That matches what we have."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:41:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Thank you very much, Tony. Have a good week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:41:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, and safe travels."
    }
  ],
